  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building in green transition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to increase Senegalese petroleum institutions&apos; knowledge on: 

- Governance of the petroleum sector, with particular interest in the Norwegian model regarding the allocation of exploration and production licenses, taxation, and the management of revenues through a sovereign wealth fund. 
- Mechanisms for the preservation of marine biodiversity and the coexistence of fisheries and petroleum activities. 
- Financing of the green transition, based on revenues from fossil energy sources, as well as the development of renewable energy and hydrogen. 
- Education and capacity building. 
- Research, innovation, and technology transfer. 
- Use of oil revenues to achieve societal development, both nationally and locally.</narrative>
  </description>
